### Webhooks: admin-only subscription CRUD
### Mirrors tests/integration/test_webhooks_api.py. Delivery + signing is covered by the worker
### tests (tests/unit/…webhooks and tests/integration). See docs/adr/0010-signed-webhooks-and-delivery-worker.md.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### Admin login
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@aurora-clinic.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### A clinic to scope the subscription to
# @name clinics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/clinics?limit=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.access_token}}

### Create a subscription. The `secret` is used to sign deliveries (HMAC-SHA256, X-Signature).
# @name sub
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/webhooks/subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clinic_id": "{{clinics.response.body.data.0.id}}",
  "url": "https://example.com/webhooks/aurora",
  "secret": "whsec_demo_do_not_use_in_prod",
  "event_types": ["appointment.created", "appointment.cancelled"]
}

### List subscriptions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/webhooks/subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.access_token}}

### Delete it
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/webhooks/subscriptions/{{sub.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.access_token}}

### A patient may NOT manage subscriptions — expect 403
# @name patientLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "patient@aurora-clinic.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/webhooks/subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{patientLogin.response.body.access_token}}
